msgstr "Připomínka platby objednávky {order_number}"

#: includes/class-pmfio-email-reminder.php:36
msgid "Waiting for your payment"
msgstr "Čekáme na platbu"

#: includes/class-pmfio-email-reminder.php:44
msgid "Hello, we have not received the payment for your order {order_number} yet. If you have already paid, it may simply not have arrived yet – in that case please ignore this e-mail. Otherwise you will find the payment details below."
msgstr "Dobrý den, k Vaší objednávce {order_number} jsme zatím neobdrželi platbu. Pokud jste už platili, platba se možná ještě nepropsala – v tom případě tento e-mail prosím ignorujte. Jinak níže najdete údaje k platbě."

